  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-update-radar",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness 插件：检查已装 link: 插件是否存在上游更新。"
    },
    {
      "section": "用途",
      "text": "读取 profile dependencies 中的全部 `link:` 路径，对含 `.git` 的目录执行 `git rev-parse HEAD` 与 `git ls-remote origin HEAD`，对比本地与上游。"
    },
    {
      "section": "用法",
      "text": "- 工具：`update_radar`（无参数）\n\n示例：\n\n```json\n{ \"checked\": 32,\n  \"behind\": [ { \"plugin\": \"dsh-notification\", \"local\": \"96413d33\", \"upstream\": \"3e33100f\" } ],\n  \"upToDate\": [ { \"plugin\": \"dsh-genui\", \"local\": \"57b43382\", \"upstream\": \"57b43382\" } ] }\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "可靠性",
      "text": "- 只读：仅执行 rev-parse / ls-remote，不拉取、不改动任何仓库；\n- git 失败（无仓库/网络异常）返回 null 字段，不影响整体报告；\n- 零依赖、无自定义会话事件、无 HTTP 路由。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add link:/path/to/dsh-update-radar"
    },
    {
      "section": "重启 dsh web",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
